{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Approximately Up</i> is your best chance to experience spaceflight in whatever you and your crew can bolt together! Build epic spaceships or barely flying trashcans \u2014 it\u2019s entirely up to you. Control your creation from a first-person view right from the deck of your ship. Complete challenging objectives, hunt achievements, face the dangers of space, and collect new components to expand your current spacecraft \u2014 or build hundreds of new ones. One is never enough!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Build spaceships!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything begins with a single piece of frame and grows into a massive, complex ship built from thousands of components. Create automated systems, experiment with different input controllers, sensors, and meters \u2014 connect them to whatever you need, and let the magic (or chaos) happen! Once it looks ready (or not), hit launch and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/eb5a69329fb512df1584b88025dc1992.poster.avif?t=1763212513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/eb5a69329fb512df1584b88025dc1992.webm?t=1763212513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Complete challenging objectives!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental power sources that need to be delivered to a station on another planet \u2014 causing unexpected power outages mid-flight? Some strange energy crystal charging up like a ticking time bomb? Or maybe it\u2019s just a massive, ridiculously heavy submarine this time? Can your spaceship handle that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/173fd414913bf6f033b7946a9fad32b5.poster.avif?t=1763212513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/173fd414913bf6f033b7946a9fad32b5.webm?t=1763212513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore the new planets!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the planet covered in oceans? What\u2019s hiding beneath that thick atmosphere? Can you see the surface through those massive clouds? Everything\u2019s waiting for you to find out! Explore <strong>17 unique planets</strong>, each with its own look, feel, and <strong>dynamic soundtrack</strong>\u00a0that changes in real time as you explore and make new discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.poster.avif?t=1763212513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.webm?t=1763212513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Blame each other!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who forgot to connect that cable? Who mounted the thruster backward? Who forgot the solar panels? Or the door-opening button? Is the radar working? How about the batteries? Enjoy the hilarious chaos in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong> with up to 4 players \u2014 and find out once and for all... WHOSE FAULT WAS IT?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.poster.avif?t=1763212513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.webm?t=1763212513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904850?t=1763212513","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/0befa2733b4a7c84a493d0e2dbf386ea0d447f34/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763212513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/1a34e4458ca64fb364757b1461d32e231779e63d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763212513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/1a34e4458ca64fb364757b1461d32e231779e63d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763212513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Approximately Up</i> is your best chance to experience spaceflight in whatever you and your crew can bolt together! Build epic spaceships or barely flying trashcans \u2014 it\u2019s entirely up to you. Control your creation from a first-person view right from the deck of your ship. Complete challenging objectives, hunt achievements, face the dangers of space, and collect new components to expand your current spacecraft \u2014 or build hundreds of new ones. One is never enough!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Buil