Can you see the surface through those massive clouds? Everything\u2019s waiting for you to find out! Explore <strong>17 unique planets</strong>, each with its own look, feel, and <strong>dynamic soundtrack</strong>\u00a0that changes in real time as you explore and make new discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.poster.avif?t=1763212513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.webm?t=1763212513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Blame each other!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who forgot to connect that cable? Who mounted the thruster backward? Who forgot the solar panels? Or the door-opening button? Is the radar working? How about the batteries? Enjoy the hilarious chaos in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong> with up to 4 players \u2014 and find out once and for all... WHOSE FAULT WAS IT?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.poster.avif?t=1763212513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.webm?t=1763212513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Approximately Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/a9ef1c76a9bcc19c727e26b42e010be